<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Contact | Causewave Innovations LLP</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/global.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50">
  <nav class="bg-white border-b sticky top-0 z-50">
    <div class="max-w-screen-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-5 flex justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="flex items-center gap-x-3"><img src="/logo_2.png" alt="Causewave" class="h-10 w-auto"></a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-8 py-20">
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Ready to build CSR programs that deliver real results?</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl text-slate-600">Whether you're planning your first CSR initiative or looking to strengthen existing programs, our team is here to help. We typically respond within 24 hours.</p>

    <form class="mt-12 space-y-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-2">Your Name</label>
          <input type="text" class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-3.5" placeholder="Priya Sharma">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-2">Company</label>
          <input type="text" class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-3.5" placeholder="Tata Consumer Products">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-2">Work Email</label>
        <input type="email" class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl px-5 py-3.5" placeholder="you@company.com">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 mb-2">Tell us about your project</label>
        <textarea rows="6" class="w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-3xl px-5 py-4" placeholder="We're looking to measure the impact of our education initiative across 5 states..."></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="w-full py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-teal-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-3xl">Send Message</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</body>
</html>